 <ca xlink:href="/rest/c/Streams">Streams</ca>
 <l>LGPL</l>
 <s>Allows stream based access to any variable.</s>
 <d>Stream_Var can be registered as a stream with stream_register_wrapper()
  and allows stream based acces to variables in any scope.
